# Reset the reveal so the scene plays correctly on a replay or a reloaded save.
set {elion_name} = "Elion"
set {theo_name} = "Theo"
set {cassia_name} = "???"

narrator: Once again, Remi finished his dance beautifully, this time under Theo's amazed gaze. #id:32
narrator: Theo stared at him in disbelief, clearly impressed by what he had just witnessed. #id:33

join Theo (Surprised) leftmost
Theo (Surprised): Whoa- #id:34
Theo (Thinking): I must admit, I had my doubts at first... but you really are good at this, Mr. Remi. #id:35
join elion (Default) right
elion (Default): Just as I expected from Sir Remi! Another wonderful performance! #id:36
join remi (Please) left
remi (Please): Squeak! #id:37
Theo (Default): Then it's settled. Count me in as another member of your team. #id:38
Theo (Smile): I hope we'll get along well. #id:39
elion (Smile): Thank you very much! #id:3a
remi (Happy): Squeak! Squeak!! #id:3b
Theo (Default): So… what now? #id:3c
elion (Determined): We have three members now, so we are nearly there! Let us go find the final member of our group! #id:3d
Theo (Thinking): Hmm… #id:3e
Theo (Default): And do you have any idea who that last person might be? #id:3f
elion (Default): From the bottom of my heart, I can confidently say… #id:40
elion (Smile): I have absolutely no idea! #id:41
remi (Sad): …squeak… #id:42
Theo (Crashout): …I see. #id:43

narrator: The three of them stood there in silence, staring at one another without a single idea coming to mind. #id:44
narrator: After a long moment, Theo was the first to speak. #id:45

Theo (Thinking): ...Actually, I think I might know someone. #id:46
remi (Confused): Squeak...? #id:47
Theo (Default): Before I ran into you two, I saw someone wandering around nearby. #id:48
Theo (Thinking): She's incredibly quick on her feet, with sharp reflexes, perfect balance, and precise movements... Honestly, those skills would be perfect for dancing. #id:49
Theo (Default): If we can convince her to join us, I think we would have a pretty good chance of winning this contest. #id:4a
elion (Determined): Oh! Then we must find her at once! #id:4b
Theo (Thinking): Yeah... but, uh... we should probably be a little careful when we approach her. #id:4c
elion (Confused): Careful? #id:4d
Theo (Default): Well, she can be... uhh… #id:4e
Theo (Crashout): Intense…? #id:4f

narrator: And so, the three of them set off in search of the mysterious woman Theo had spoken of. #id:50

leave --All-- 

[background arg="res://backgrounds/meadow.webp" fade="1.0"]

narrator: They searched around the nearby streets, following the direction Theo had last seen her heading. #id:51
narrator: After a short while, Theo suddenly slowed his pace and looked ahead. #id:52

join elion right
join remi left 
join Theo leftmost 
Theo (Default): ...There. #id:53

narrator: A red-skinned tiefling stood with her back to them, white hair shifting above a dark scarf draped like a short cloak as she quietly searched the area. #id:54
narrator: With her back turned to them, none of them could see her face. #id:55
narrator: While the group stood there in silence, Theo cautiously stepped forward. #id:56

Theo: Hey, Cas- #id:57

narrator: Suddenly, in an instant, she vanished from sight. #id:58

Theo (Surprised): Huh-?! #id:59

narrator: Before anyone could react, that tiefling was already behind him, a black dagger resting against his neck. #id:5a

elion (Surprised): Sir Theo!!! #id:5b
remi (Surprised): Squeak!!! #id:5c
Theo (Shocked): !!! #id:5d

narrator: The mysterious tiefling paused at Theo's terrified reaction before immediately lowering her weapon. #id:5e

join cassia (Intimidate) rightmost 

cassia (Intimidate): Oh- it's just you. #id:5f

narrator: As if nothing had happened, the dagger vanished from sight just as quickly as it had appeared. #id:60
narrator: Standing before them now was an intimidating-looking tiefling, her eyes hidden beneath a dark blindfold. #id:61

Theo (Crashout): …!!! #id:62
elion (Smile): Ah! Lady Cassia! So it really is you. We meet again! #id:63

# Elion says her name here, so the name box stops saying ??? from this point on.
set {cassia_name} = "Cassia"

remi: Squeak?! #id:64

narrator: Somehow, it seemed Elion knew this intimidating tiefling as well. #id:65
narrator: At this point, Remi was beginning to wonder just how many people Elion knew. #id:66

Theo (Shocked): Uh- Umm… Ahem-! #id:67
Theo (Default): Um, Mr. Remi, this is [b]Cassia[/b]. She is- well… a [b]rogue[/b] I and Elion have met from our earlier missio- #id:68
cassia (Default): State your purpose. #id:69
Theo (Shocked): …! #id:6a
elion (Determined): We heard that this festival is hosting a dancing contest, so we have been searching for another member to join our team! #id:6b
elion (Default): There are three of us so far. If you joined us, our team would finally be complete. #id:6c
cassia: Three? #id:6d
elion (Smile): Yes! Sir Theo, myself, and of course, Sir Remi! #id:6e
cassia (Confused): … #id:6f
cassia: Who the hell is Remi? #id:70
elion (Surprised): Oh! Pardon me. I completely forgot to introduce him. #id:71

narrator: Elion enthusiastically knelt beside Remi and gestured toward him. #id:72

elion (Smile): This is Sir Remi, the finest dancer I have ever had the honor of witnessing! #id:73
remi (Happy): Squeak! #id:74
cassia (Disapproved): … #id:75
cassia (Default): I am going to ignore the fact that you can apparently talk to a rat and move on. #id:76
Theo (Crashout): (!!! Thank god. I'm not the only one wondering how the hell Elion can understand a rat!!!) #id:77
cassia: So you came all this way just to ask if I would join a dancing contest? #id:78
Theo (Default): ...Exactly. #id:79
elion (Default): With your remarkable speed and precision, I am certain you would be a great addition to our- #id:7a
cassia: I refuse. #id:7b
remi (Surprised): Squeak?!! #id:7c
cassia: I have no interest in wasting my time on some dancing contest. #id:7d
cassia (Mocking): Besides, a team led by a rat? You cannot be serious. #id:7e
remi (Sad): Squeak… #id:7f
elion (Sad): Lady Cassia! There is no need to speak of Sir Remi that way. #id:80
cassia (Intimidate): I'll speak however I please, don't tell me what to do. #id:81
elion: Lady Cassia, please reconsider. #id:82
elion: Sir Remi has worked very hard for this opportunity. I truly believe he deserves a chance. #id:83
remi (Please): Squeak… #id:84
cassia (Surprised): And why should that matter to me? #id:85
Theo (Thinking): U-Um... maybe… #id:86
Theo (Default): Maybe you could watch him dance first…? #id:87
cassia (Intimidate): …What? #id:88
Theo (Shocked): J-Just once! Then you can decide after that. #id:89
Theo (Crashout): (Please…! For my research fund…!) #id:8a
cassia (Disapproved): Hm… #id:8b
elion: Please, Lady Cassia. #id:8c
Theo (Default): Y- Yes! Please… #id:8d
remi (Please): Squeak! #id:8e
cassia (Default): … #id:8f
cassia: If this rat is really as good as you two claim, then prove it to me. #id:90
cassia: Impress me, and I might reconsider joining this little team of yours. #id:91
remi (Happy): Squeak! #id:92

narrator: Remi stepped forward without hesitation, determined to prove himself once again. #id:93
narrator: Cassia folded her arms and stood silently, waiting to see if it was truly worth her time. #id:94

cassia (Intimidate): Go on, rat. Show me what you can do. #id:95

narrator: With Elion and Theo watching closely behind him, Remi took his place and prepared to dance. #id:96